    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκτα-ετηρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cycle of eight years,</i> used at Athens before
